====== Orange Pi Plus (H3) ======

For further Allwinner-based boards, please refer to [[docs:techref:hardware:soc:soc.allwinner.sunxi|soc.allwinner.sunxi]]

==== Availability ====

The board is available from various vendors, including the manufacturer itself, see [[http://www.orangepi.org/|here for Orange Pi Plus]].

Further details on the board: http://linux-sunxi.org/Xunlong_Orange_Pi_Plus


